Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 17:14:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Lost Isles headless run complete - 97 quests PASS
 (F-219)

- move: nav_map override on path/path_to/ground (plan on a terrain-swap map's navmesh)
- rpc: route path/ground queries to the phase's swap navmesh, fall back to base where it has no floor
- runner: long routes split along the planned path, phase inference by overlap with zone
  definitions (shared-point spawns OR'd), summoned quest givers (Greely), condition-gated quests
  of such givers, missing on-use items farmed from their drop source, evading mobs skipped and
  other spawn points walked, GO SmartAI kill credits, failed turn-ins retried, phase-aware
  trainer choice + refused spells remembered per character
- vehicles: open-from-vehicle locks only board summonable vehicles, re-board click vehicles
  before a fight, sustained bar rotation against a boss, weapon-damage bar spells, vehicle made
  the mover on boarding, ground vehicles driven on the navmesh (straight lines left the Footbomb
  Uniform under the terrain, failing every cast on LoS)
- travel/StepFailed lines carry target, navmesh and source line

